  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project to strengthen CSOs&apos; ability to empower youth in Ukraine with life skills to withstand the pressures of war and to create a better future for themselves and their communities once they have won the peace.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In general terms, the main target group is the youth of Ukraine. More specifically, the main target group is the youth that take part in the Star for Life Ukraine programmes. A second target group is the CSOs in Ukraine that will benefit from being part of the CSO network that Star for Life Ukraine will develop and capacitate.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has four general objectives: (1) to strengthen the implementing organisation Star for Life Ukraine; (2) to create a strong CSO network working for the mental health and wellbeing of youth in Ukraine; (3) to scale-up the quality and reach of the Star for life Ukraine programmes, and; (4) to strengthen the ability of the international NGO Star for Life International to support Star for Life organisations and CSO networks in other countries.</narrative>
  </description>
